#: ../effects.rst:85
msgid ""
"Effects with ``Margin: Left``, ``Margin: Top``, ``Margin: Right``, and "
"``Margin: Bottom`` controls can also be adjusted directly in the video "
"preview. Select the effect, then drag the preview rectangle to move the "
